WEBVTT

00:00:13.050 --> 00:00:13.540
What?

00:00:13.870 --> 00:00:14.610
What's wrong?

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:17.300
Didn't you hear a baby's voice just now?

00:00:17.510 --> 00:00:18.390
No, not really.

00:00:22.240 --> 00:00:23.010
I heard it.

00:00:23.670 --> 00:00:26.830
Don't you think it's scary to hear a baby's voice in a place like this?

00:00:36.760 --> 00:00:40.720
The Voice of the Night

00:00:47.670 --> 00:00:48.370
Did you see it?

00:00:48.940 --> 00:00:50.750
Who are you?

00:00:51.250 --> 00:00:52.340
What was that earlier?

00:00:52.340 --> 00:00:53.820
It has nothing to do with you.

00:00:54.350 --> 00:00:55.280
Forget about this.

00:01:04.930 --> 00:01:05.690
Where is it?

00:01:05.690 --> 00:01:06.580
The Corpse?

00:01:06.580 --> 00:01:07.170
Makina.

00:01:09.180 --> 00:01:10.410
It struck again.

00:01:13.760 --> 00:01:15.220
As always only one victim.

00:01:16.300 --> 00:01:18.050
And no sign of the Corpse.

00:01:25.820 --> 00:01:26.610
Hey.

00:01:26.610 --> 00:01:27.570
Oori.

00:01:28.100 --> 00:01:29.730
Did you ever hear this story?

00:01:31.030 --> 00:01:32.350
Which one?

00:01:32.710 --> 00:01:37.130
The story about this high school girl that abandoned her baby after secretly giving birth.

00:01:38.180 --> 00:01:40.050
Why are high school girls all you talk about?

00:01:40.420 --> 00:01:41.480
Anyway.

00:01:41.520 --> 00:01:44.940
They say that you can hear the baby crying at night.

00:01:44.940 --> 00:01:48.460
Girls nowadays won't get scared by such a lame story.

00:01:48.890 --> 00:01:52.450
But this is a true story.

00:01:52.750 --> 00:01:53.570
Kagami?

00:01:53.970 --> 00:01:55.020
I'm sorry.

00:01:55.020 --> 00:01:56.910
I just don't feel like myself today.

00:01:57.560 --> 00:01:58.660
Oori.

00:01:58.660 --> 00:02:02.600
Could the baby have cast a curse on you?

00:02:03.100 --> 00:02:03.990
I hope not.

00:02:03.990 --> 00:02:05.010
Please tell me it didn't.

00:02:05.010 --> 00:02:07.840
Because you and I are connected!

00:02:09.160 --> 00:02:10.080
Idiot.

00:02:10.550 --> 00:02:11.680
That hurts!

00:02:11.910 --> 00:02:14.140
You bitch!

00:02:22.380 --> 00:02:25.870
We've bought you some onigiri and rice gruel.

00:02:25.870 --> 00:02:28.050
You should have told us you had a cold!

00:02:28.050 --> 00:02:29.120
I'm sorry.

00:02:31.340 --> 00:02:33.180
It was the Sekuu temple right?

00:02:33.180 --> 00:02:34.510
Should I give them a call?

00:02:35.300 --> 00:02:36.030
It's alright.

00:02:37.570 --> 00:02:40.160
It's no good if I can't take care of myself.

00:02:41.270 --> 00:02:42.240
Very well.

00:02:42.910 --> 00:02:44.100
Do as you wish.

00:02:46.110 --> 00:02:46.980
We're leaving.

00:02:48.580 --> 00:02:49.150
Why?

00:02:51.520 --> 00:02:54.780
He can't sleep when you guys are around.

00:02:57.810 --> 00:03:00.540
We'll check on you another time.

00:03:04.070 --> 00:03:05.220
See you.

00:03:21.080 --> 00:03:22.640
Water.

00:03:23.520 --> 00:03:24.670
Water...

00:03:25.170 --> 00:03:25.770
Here.

00:03:53.540 --> 00:03:55.790
Tea shop
Partenon

00:03:57.730 --> 00:03:59.450
He's got a cold, so he's not coming.

00:03:59.870 --> 00:04:01.300
Unbelievable.

00:04:01.400 --> 00:04:02.930
You wanna go visit him?

00:04:03.060 --> 00:04:04.830
You can dress up like a nurse?

00:04:05.470 --> 00:04:06.560
Huh?

00:04:15.390 --> 00:04:16.840
Not again.

00:04:16.840 --> 00:04:18.590
Why here?

00:04:18.920 --> 00:04:20.930
I don't remember getting cursed.

00:04:31.280 --> 00:04:32.970
It's calling you.

00:04:34.180 --> 00:04:35.290
Why me?

00:04:36.090 --> 00:04:38.890
It's calling for help.

00:04:50.170 --> 00:04:51.040
Alright.

00:04:53.490 --> 00:04:55.410
Did you do the autopsy yet?

00:04:55.800 --> 00:04:56.820
I don't know.

00:05:01.110 --> 00:05:02.670
With some milk please.

00:05:05.190 --> 00:05:05.950
It's a Corpse.

00:05:09.220 --> 00:05:10.180
Don't lose it.

00:05:10.600 --> 00:05:11.750
Don't screw up this time.

00:05:15.480 --> 00:05:16.770
I can feel it too.

00:05:16.770 --> 00:05:18.000
It's very close!

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:19.430
It's moving fast.

00:05:19.790 --> 00:05:21.370
This one is different from the others.

00:05:24.300 --> 00:05:27.510
Warning for high vehicles

00:05:38.680 --> 00:05:40.490
I didn't even lose sight of it for one second.

00:05:40.490 --> 00:05:41.450
Really.

00:05:41.940 --> 00:05:43.180
Another one of its victims?

00:05:44.840 --> 00:05:46.390
This time we've lost.

00:05:47.280 --> 00:05:48.360
It's not about winning or losing.

00:05:48.360 --> 00:05:49.520
What would you call it then?

00:05:49.890 --> 00:05:52.620
The times that we lose, people get killed.

00:05:55.540 --> 00:05:57.290
Name: Amakuda Setsuna
Identification

00:06:06.080 --> 00:06:08.940
Sekuu temple

00:06:13.420 --> 00:06:16.840
It couldn't possibly be an invisible Corpse.

00:06:17.340 --> 00:06:19.270
How much longer are you going to waste my time?

00:06:20.010 --> 00:06:21.270
I'm talking about you, Tagami.

00:06:22.450 --> 00:06:25.450
The chance that Corpses will appear in this area are high.

00:06:25.810 --> 00:06:29.910
I've got five of them, and Tagami ten.

00:06:32.170 --> 00:06:35.880
This hospital is lacking someone in charge at the moment.

00:06:36.420 --> 00:06:39.740
There is only one obstetrician in town using this advertisement.

00:06:40.910 --> 00:06:43.160
All victims are young women.

00:06:44.230 --> 00:06:46.050
One of them was pregnant.

00:06:46.050 --> 00:06:47.770
A baby's voice?

00:06:47.770 --> 00:06:52.030
Could a gynecologist or obstetrician have given stillbirth to women's babies, that then turned into Corpses?

00:06:53.600 --> 00:06:56.160
And are now making victims?

00:06:56.540 --> 00:06:58.880
A being with no attachment to this world couldn't possibly turn into a Corpse.

00:06:59.470 --> 00:07:01.830
That Corpse the other day was merely a baby.

00:07:03.050 --> 00:07:06.070
What are the results of the autopsy I asked for?

00:07:06.290 --> 00:07:08.090
There are no results yet.

00:07:08.090 --> 00:07:10.130
Above that, I fear something strange happened to the hospital.

00:07:12.390 --> 00:07:12.950
Makina.

00:07:17.200 --> 00:07:19.710
Inankan Clinic

00:07:33.340 --> 00:07:36.960
Inankan Clinic

00:07:36.960 --> 00:07:38.310
Inankai
Inankan Clinic

00:07:38.310 --> 00:07:38.680
Inankai

00:07:38.680 --> 00:07:39.300
Why me?
Inankai

00:07:39.300 --> 00:07:40.290
Why me?

00:07:41.420 --> 00:07:44.370
Because you're the boy.

00:07:45.140 --> 00:07:47.080
What do you want me to do?

00:07:51.860 --> 00:07:53.080
Damn it.

00:07:53.530 --> 00:07:55.160
My head is turning.

00:08:00.170 --> 00:08:01.890
There, there.

00:08:01.890 --> 00:08:04.910
There, there...

00:08:48.920 --> 00:08:51.830
I can't make it because I've got a patient.

00:08:52.510 --> 00:08:54.780
And I'm the only one here at the moment.

00:08:55.670 --> 00:08:57.110
Please.

00:08:57.110 --> 00:09:01.240
I don't know what to do now that my boyfriend left me.

00:09:01.780 --> 00:09:05.360
That's how young people are lately.

00:09:05.820 --> 00:09:07.780
You don't have to cry.

00:09:07.870 --> 00:09:10.070
I'll make it all right.

00:09:12.960 --> 00:09:14.960
Oh, you woke up, lad?

00:09:15.550 --> 00:09:18.020
He fainted in front of the hospital yesterday.

00:09:18.450 --> 00:09:20.320
He's got a very bad cold.

00:09:20.320 --> 00:09:23.320
He probably didn't even know that I was an obstetrician.

00:09:23.790 --> 00:09:26.100
I took care of him because I had no other choice.

00:09:26.490 --> 00:09:28.130
It looks like he got well.

00:09:28.890 --> 00:09:30.210
Thank you very much.

00:09:30.670 --> 00:09:33.010
No no, there is no need to thank me.

00:09:35.490 --> 00:09:36.960
Can I use your toilet?

00:09:37.730 --> 00:09:39.140
It's right over there.

00:09:39.450 --> 00:09:42.170
Well, I'll start the preparations.

00:09:42.510 --> 00:09:43.560
Yes.

00:09:55.490 --> 00:09:56.950
What are you doing?

00:09:57.020 --> 00:09:57.940
Nothing.

00:09:57.970 --> 00:10:00.800
Eh, did you get pregnant?

00:10:01.720 --> 00:10:05.040
It's the third time I run into you while chasing a Corpse.

00:10:05.130 --> 00:10:06.470
This can't be a coincidence.

00:10:06.540 --> 00:10:07.850
Did someone send you here?

00:10:08.250 --> 00:10:09.690
Send me?

00:10:10.140 --> 00:10:10.710
Forget it.

00:10:11.150 --> 00:10:12.270
There's no time.

00:10:15.080 --> 00:10:15.780
Hey.

00:10:23.970 --> 00:10:24.600
Hey, wait!

00:10:25.550 --> 00:10:26.730
Wait a moment!

00:10:27.080 --> 00:10:28.510
Don't follow me!

00:10:30.850 --> 00:10:32.960
Shikabane Hime or Hoshimura Makina?

00:10:33.020 --> 00:10:34.220
Which one is your real name?

00:10:35.800 --> 00:10:38.360
Shikabane Hime is the alias I take when I'm out to kill Corpses.

00:10:38.570 --> 00:10:41.200
So can I call you Hoshimura-san?

00:10:43.030 --> 00:10:44.740
Intensive Care Nursery

00:11:07.250 --> 00:11:08.130
Out of the way.

00:11:08.430 --> 00:11:09.710
What are you going to do?

00:11:10.500 --> 00:11:13.730
Five women have been murdered by Corpses already.

00:11:13.920 --> 00:11:16.170
Only thing we know is that a baby's voice could be heard at the crime scene.

00:11:16.720 --> 00:11:20.520
Also there is a chance that all of those women have come to this hospital.

00:11:21.220 --> 00:11:22.980
Only with that info you believe that this child is a Corpse?!

00:11:23.750 --> 00:11:24.970
Watch closely.

00:11:25.060 --> 00:11:26.890
That is not a newborn child.

00:11:27.250 --> 00:11:29.320
It's already the size of a three month old baby.

00:11:29.950 --> 00:11:32.870
Why would something like that be sleeping at a place like this?

00:11:33.740 --> 00:11:36.770
That doctor's surely being used by a Corpse too.

00:11:43.250 --> 00:11:44.420
Could you...

00:11:45.280 --> 00:11:46.980
...help me?

00:11:47.520 --> 00:11:49.580
But this child is not a monster!

00:11:50.120 --> 00:11:51.490
It's just the outside!

00:11:52.490 --> 00:11:53.640
Out of the way!

00:11:54.360 --> 00:11:55.330
Stop it!

00:11:59.980 --> 00:12:00.610
I'm sorry.

00:12:01.990 --> 00:12:02.860
Well.

00:12:02.970 --> 00:12:04.170
Do you get it now?

00:12:04.300 --> 00:12:05.970
This is the smell of a Corpse.

00:12:06.400 --> 00:12:07.750
I am dead.

00:12:08.290 --> 00:12:09.740
Bodies don't lie.

00:12:10.320 --> 00:12:11.700
That child is just the same.

00:12:11.880 --> 00:12:13.570
It must have the same smell as I.

00:12:14.310 --> 00:12:15.690
Smell it.

00:12:21.790 --> 00:12:25.090
This boy only smells like milk.

00:12:25.560 --> 00:12:26.520
You're lying!

00:12:26.520 --> 00:12:28.020
I've had enough of you!

00:12:36.330 --> 00:12:38.330
You'd better let that boy go.

00:12:38.830 --> 00:12:40.270
I'm taking it with me.

00:12:40.680 --> 00:12:42.750
That boys isn't a Corpse.

00:12:43.280 --> 00:12:44.900
We are the ones who decide that.

00:12:46.480 --> 00:12:47.470
Hoshimura-san!

00:13:01.770 --> 00:13:02.940
Hoshimura-san!

00:13:13.010 --> 00:13:14.710
The cells of a Corpse?

00:13:15.020 --> 00:13:15.550
Yes.

00:13:15.920 --> 00:13:23.150
I can clearly see the cells that can give birth to a Corpse in the victims bodies.

00:13:23.300 --> 00:13:28.510
So somebody planted parts of a Corpse into the humans to change them into fake Corpses with some kind of technology?

00:13:29.590 --> 00:13:34.000
Makina and the others are chasing fake Corpses, that are actually the victims?

00:13:34.930 --> 00:13:36.050
That's why we couldn't find the Corpse.

00:13:36.430 --> 00:13:39.810
In the end the victims returned to their human form and died.

00:13:39.990 --> 00:13:41.710
But could that be possible?

00:13:42.090 --> 00:13:43.530
It's happening.

00:13:43.930 --> 00:13:47.210
We still know little about Corpses.

00:13:47.380 --> 00:13:48.810
We can only acknowledge this.

00:13:49.000 --> 00:13:50.320
But who could have...

00:13:51.630 --> 00:13:55.030
Is someone trying to increase the number of Corpses?

00:13:55.730 --> 00:13:58.290
Or could this be some kind of experiment.

00:13:58.690 --> 00:13:59.610
But Kagami...

00:14:00.210 --> 00:14:03.240
I heard that there are more corpses in the environment lately.

00:14:03.770 --> 00:14:08.530
Not only that, I also heard that we aren't always the ones chasing them anymore.

00:14:08.650 --> 00:14:10.810
Don't be foolish, Rika.

00:14:11.280 --> 00:14:13.170
I'm the best leader ever.

00:14:13.350 --> 00:14:15.260
I'm not just a group leader like you.

00:14:16.460 --> 00:14:20.250
I may not have deserved my promotion but...

00:14:20.870 --> 00:14:22.720
Makina and I will get those Corpses.

00:14:23.410 --> 00:14:25.070
I can promise you that.

00:14:36.530 --> 00:14:37.220
Makina?

00:14:41.240 --> 00:14:42.560
There, there.

00:14:42.920 --> 00:14:45.220
There, there, there.

00:14:47.530 --> 00:14:51.260
I can't believe that a Corpse obeys a human.

00:14:51.650 --> 00:14:53.170
Does it look strange to you?

00:14:53.860 --> 00:14:57.110
That baby is hers.

00:14:57.690 --> 00:15:03.180
Unfortunately, she had a heart attack while giving birth.

00:15:03.180 --> 00:15:04.070
And then...

00:15:04.340 --> 00:15:05.690
She turned into a Corpse.

00:15:06.120 --> 00:15:07.640
So you know.

00:15:08.100 --> 00:15:12.050
If I wouldn't be here, nobody would take care of that boy.

00:15:12.650 --> 00:15:16.210
That's why she obeys my will.

00:15:16.770 --> 00:15:17.620
Impossible.

00:15:19.800 --> 00:15:21.080
Corpses...

00:15:21.630 --> 00:15:24.800
I heard some rumors about them from other doctors.

00:15:24.800 --> 00:15:26.920
Deceased humans coming back from the dead...

00:15:26.920 --> 00:15:28.730
...under a strange form of life.

00:15:28.730 --> 00:15:30.560
Who could have thought those rumors to be true?

00:15:32.460 --> 00:15:37.410
Don't you think it would be wonderful if humans could control the undead?

00:15:37.410 --> 00:15:39.030
Are you going to put that in a human?

00:15:39.640 --> 00:15:42.000
Even by doing that you won't become immortal!

00:15:42.640 --> 00:15:43.460
I see.

00:15:43.930 --> 00:15:45.450
You are the one who did that to those women!

00:15:46.140 --> 00:15:48.900
I will succeed some day.

00:15:49.530 --> 00:15:52.450
I knew that people like you would come some day.

00:15:53.020 --> 00:15:55.260
Somebody warned me about you.

00:15:56.640 --> 00:15:57.250
Hoshimura-san!

00:15:57.510 --> 00:15:58.410
Hoshimura?

00:15:58.600 --> 00:16:04.940
Many years ago a family called Hoshimura died when their house burned down.

00:16:04.940 --> 00:16:06.710
Are they your family?

00:16:08.710 --> 00:16:10.520
You aren't turning into a monster.

00:16:10.990 --> 00:16:13.880
I should have given you a greater dose.

00:16:14.580 --> 00:16:15.740
No reaction at all?

00:16:15.830 --> 00:16:18.270
But I'll just continue the experiment.

00:16:25.780 --> 00:16:27.120
I'm that Hoshimura.

00:16:29.740 --> 00:16:32.370
I am the daughter of the family who died in that fire.

00:16:32.940 --> 00:16:34.150
But the cause of death wasn't the fire.

00:16:34.880 --> 00:16:37.710
I've already died once, so a Corpse's flesh won't do anything to me.

00:16:40.650 --> 00:16:41.440
You know.

00:16:41.970 --> 00:16:43.760
I've already become a Corpse anyway.

00:16:43.870 --> 00:16:46.500
So maybe It would have been better If I'd Iost all my humanity.

00:16:59.200 --> 00:17:00.390
Trying to become human again...

00:17:00.690 --> 00:17:02.500
Or maybe something close to it.

00:17:02.830 --> 00:17:04.970
Do you really think you're any different from a monster?

00:17:05.660 --> 00:17:08.080
Only the fact that you are helping humans turn into Corpses...

00:17:08.080 --> 00:17:10.040
You are already a Corpse.

00:17:10.440 --> 00:17:11.860
And I am...

00:17:12.120 --> 00:17:13.040
It's useless!

00:17:13.040 --> 00:17:14.690
Corpses are immortal!

00:17:15.750 --> 00:17:16.830
I am the immortal killer.

00:17:17.790 --> 00:17:18.710
Shikabane Hime!

00:17:27.480 --> 00:17:28.100
Stop it!

00:17:28.770 --> 00:17:32.090
This man has caused at least five corpses to enter this world.

00:17:32.090 --> 00:17:32.760
And five deaths.

00:17:33.450 --> 00:17:35.390
You are a Corpse killer!

00:17:35.920 --> 00:17:37.360
He is even inferior to Corpses.

00:17:37.490 --> 00:17:39.040
Even so, he is human!

00:17:39.040 --> 00:17:39.760
Just like you!

00:17:40.100 --> 00:17:41.720
I am not human!

00:17:47.320 --> 00:17:48.070
What?

00:17:48.070 --> 00:17:48.700
Brother?

00:17:49.300 --> 00:17:50.120
Why?

00:17:52.790 --> 00:17:53.550
I can't...

00:17:54.470 --> 00:17:55.790
My head is turning.

00:18:04.780 --> 00:18:05.790
Brother?

00:18:05.790 --> 00:18:09.920
I never heard of someone going to a gynecologist when having a bad cold.

00:18:10.030 --> 00:18:10.600
Eh?

00:18:11.640 --> 00:18:13.750
The police contacted us.

00:18:14.510 --> 00:18:16.130
So I came to get you.

00:18:16.920 --> 00:18:19.230
That doctor got arrested they say.

00:18:20.290 --> 00:18:23.480
They said you were sleeping while everything happened.

00:18:24.720 --> 00:18:25.950
I see.

00:18:27.990 --> 00:18:28.620
Did something happen?

00:18:29.480 --> 00:18:30.200
Say?

00:18:30.910 --> 00:18:32.970
Wasn't there a girl and a baby there?

00:18:33.330 --> 00:18:34.060
Not at all.

00:18:34.520 --> 00:18:37.150
Your fever probably caused you to dream that.

00:18:39.330 --> 00:18:41.140
That's something Sasae gave you.

00:18:41.700 --> 00:18:44.470
You would probably need it if you want to dream about women.

00:18:45.030 --> 00:18:47.630
Are you trying to make me do this even when I have a fever?

00:18:48.100 --> 00:18:51.850
Oori is a pervert!

00:18:52.780 --> 00:18:54.400
It's not me!

00:18:59.040 --> 00:19:02.600
Why does your brother always appear when there's Corpses around?

00:19:03.420 --> 00:19:04.720
Maybe he's stalking you.

00:19:05.860 --> 00:19:08.390
Someday he'll find out about you too, Keisei!

00:19:08.660 --> 00:19:12.790
That's why I will never fire you.

00:19:12.790 --> 00:19:13.370
Well?

00:19:14.760 --> 00:19:15.590
Of course.

00:19:20.400 --> 00:19:22.360
We shall take care of the baby.

00:19:22.900 --> 00:19:24.810
We've got an orphanage for cases like this.

00:19:25.300 --> 00:19:26.150
What do you say?

00:19:26.400 --> 00:19:27.330
Doctor Rokuoka.

00:19:28.040 --> 00:19:29.430
Could you please explain to me?

00:19:30.120 --> 00:19:36.180
Did you think that using Corpse's cells was the only chance to prolong your wife's life?

00:19:36.810 --> 00:19:39.390
I'm sure that somebody put you up to this experiment.

